      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَوَّاسٌ</span></b>  One <i>who treads upon everything:</i> or
<i>who comes into the midst of a people, and does
mischief among them.</i> (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Hence, (TA,)
The <i>lion.</i> (K, TA.) And in like manner it is
applied to a man. (TA.)

